{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3276a0efe5aaa2e0bfee4168bcf595c36f7b45e2595b7e38cde22db07378a78f","ja":"そして、トークイベントが始まって……","zh":"然后，脱口秀活动开始了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"57981fc1bc0f96c99ebd1b037cd2884bf03ea3eaeb00d32665eb1485bf574f92","ja":"それじゃあ次は……風花ちゃん！\n「この夏挑戦したいこと」は何かしら？","zh":"那么接下来是……风花！\n“这个夏天想挑战的事情”是什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"952e6e486a915ab0282c5d4d255e5293cd7cd5a0a31f2688e55fbd820ec5f63d","ja":"そうですね……私は、麦わら帽子をかぶって、\n綺麗な海辺へ行ってみたいです♪","zh":"我想想……我希望能戴着草帽，\n去美丽的海边看一看呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"70807111f5ef250e0ce4f04bbd6c9fe37efeea5bae3879c443b9f6f73aa4bb45","ja":"「風花ちゃん、かわいいー！」","zh":"“风花好可爱啊——！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3adb3376adb443e717dadc73b35a951e780f5fbcde4c2e1e3b902fc869e85349","ja":"（ふふっ、お客さんにちゃんと清楚なのが伝わってる\nみたいね。この調子で頑張ろっと♪）","zh":"（呵呵，大家好像都有感受到我的清纯呢。\n就保持这个势头继续加油吧♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4e7dbe18cb3ae26ab50d070fd3a0f329718f7ebda43345ba1586d333b8cdf6ba","ja":"イベントお疲れさま。\n風花ちゃん、とってもかわいくて素敵だったわよ♪","zh":"活动辛苦了。\n风花，你真的非常可爱又迷人哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6497bfb224bfda9b44426854c295f4539ae7d58880a9fada082afdce1ec04866","ja":"ありがとうございます！　私も、正統派アイドルらしい\n爽やかさを、しっかり表現できたかなって♪","zh":"太感谢了！我也觉得，自己好像确实好好表现出了\n正统派偶像的那种清爽感呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"573db1e103eb41a82812ba04f97af7435039d115e38df6a8e6f7d88b8564c705","ja":"この後の雑誌の取材でも、\n風花の良さをアピールできそうですわね。","zh":"在接下来的杂志采访中，\n似乎也能展现出风花的优点呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7ef07b98b74153456cef7c437d065435888a8c43c8716f040de670185d44b820","ja":"うん。次も清らかなイメージを\nいっぱいアピールできたら……。","zh":"嗯。下次也能多多展现\n清纯的形象就好了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"70c964af6fb5f04667148febc6576593cd057bed42b14aced30a4f0c1475d51b","ja":"……シャワワワワ～……","zh":"……哗啦啦啦啦～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7f45609f95193b6c8dcf2b696ebef05ff2cf7a10b031912eb5c90fe55fd7788d","ja":"って、きゃ～～～～～！？\nつ、冷たいっ！？　これって……水っ！？","zh":"等、呀啊啊啊啊啊——！？\n好、好冰！？　这难道是……水！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"8e61b448fca24f5864fe497bc6bf365edc676b5243484be8736e440734badf80","ja":"あらあら～。\nどうしたのかしら～？","zh":"哎呀哎呀～。\n怎么了呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6cb76d0a0ba5f5ac3466703a069606615105f9226c0ac247c205df10bebb7a3c","ja":"と、とにかく！　早くこちらへ！","zh":"总、总之！快到这边来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"caa9dfe0e1fb41a94049746f076da3fc3b2ae4d614057cd064960561aaab8d4b","ja":"ふぅ……まさかスプリンクラーが\n誤作動してしまうだなんて。","zh":"呼……真没想到喷淋器\n竟然会误启动。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8fa08699b0ec18b5bfebb7631e400a51eb3cc85c21953f8bf238d9d89860dcde","ja":"すっかり濡れちゃったわね……。\n取材の前に、タオルを買いに行きましょう。","zh":"都彻底湿透了呢……\n在取材之前，先去买条毛巾吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1264.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"aacd1284a314000e25ec113fd1adf3508ccecb0ac41714f035f46b8d104643a5","ja":"（うぅ、全身びしょ濡れ……。で、でも、\n気持ちを切り替えて、しっかり取材を受けなきゃ！）","zh":"（呜呜，浑身都湿透了……。但、但是，\n必须调整好心情，好好接受采访才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
